er":"tmdb_show","id":"94209","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379528","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"94354","synopsis":"苏莫婷的父母为她安排了相亲，她无奈赴约。相亲对象王小宝性格奇葩，让苏莫婷头疼不已。天机星和地魁担心苏莫婷，悄悄跟去观察。相亲过程中状况连连，王小宝的奇怪举动和言论不断，还引发了一些意外状况，天机星和地魁则在一旁暗中捣乱，这场相亲闹剧让苏莫婷尴尬又无语 。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dklRQY2vxOc0081dJny2FhwMU4w.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16720","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"121679","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42956","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"94209","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379528","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"94355","synopsis":"双十一购物狂欢节来临，苏莫婷为了优惠疯狂计算规则，忙得不可开交。天机星和地魁看着苏莫婷的样子，对人类的购物狂热感到不解。苏莫婷为了凑满减，各种商品加购、比价，甚至熬夜等待零点下单。地魁告诉她在妖界消费没这么复杂，可苏莫婷依旧沉迷其中，结果到最后还是陷入了月光困境 。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/thjgCcpZ8SfbasanyaqKzWnAM9Y.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16720","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"121679","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42956","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"94209","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379528","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"94356","synopsis":"苏莫婷和天机星、地魁在生活中发现了贫富差距的现象，他们看到富有的人生活奢华，而一些普通人却为生活奔波。为了深入了解，三人决定去体验不同阶层的生活。苏莫婷在体验过程中，看到了生活的艰辛与不易，也明白了珍惜眼前的道理，同时对三界失衡对人类生活的影响有了更深感悟 。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5mmdHKFLy4QVzYApvlDIiQzINv0.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16720","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"121679","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42956","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"94209","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379528","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"94357","synopsis":"苏莫婷宅家许久，家中卫生状况堪忧，还引来了 “四害”。“四害” 化作人形，与苏莫婷等人展开了一场 “公寓争夺战”。地魁用《六国论》之理分析局势，苏莫婷和天机星则与 “四害” 斗智斗勇。最终，苏莫婷用蚊帐成功打败 “四害”，打扫了房间，但 “四害” 却找到了新的栖息地，让人哭笑不得 。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zcHWiGAehgQSR5diM3xJbTWFVZA.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16720","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"121679","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42956","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"94209","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379528","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"94358","synopsis":"苏莫婷患上了拖延症，很多事情都拖到最后一刻才做。天机星和地魁想帮她改掉这个毛病，于是模仿童话故事中的情节来提醒她。苏莫婷在经历了一系列类似童话场景的事件后，虽然有所触动，但依旧难以克服拖延的习惯。直到最后期限来临，她才手忙脚乱地完成任务，深刻认识到拖延的危害 。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/11cVeh6CnHiNOzAUsesP8fejb6G.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16720","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"121679","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42956","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"94209","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379528","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"94359","synopsis":"苏莫婷失眠了，整晚辗转反侧。天机星和地魁为了帮她入睡，尝试了各种方法，比如数羊、播放舒缓音乐等，但都无济于事。苏莫婷在失眠中回忆起生活中的种种压力，越发难以入眠。最后，地魁用妖界的特殊方法，让苏莫婷的身心逐渐放松，终于进入了梦乡 。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nqRoYbHYACFZJuxUqpPVAhgu7bc.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"pro